<title>USA: Care Financial buys Care Concepts.</title>
<headline>Care Financial buys Care Concepts.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Care Financial Group Inc said on Monday that it acquired Care Concepts Inc.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Nevada-based Care Concepts manufactures specialized minivans for the physically challenged, including wheelchair users.</p>
<p>Care Financial Group said in a statement that the buyout is the company's first application of a strategic plan to buy complementary corporations that can dramatically enhance shareholder value.</p>
</text>
